{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing invocation-end ordering contract.** Reversing `onInvocationEnd` changes documented registration-order behavior and can break plugins whose flushing or cleanup depends on earlier plugins running first. Retain registration order, or introduce an explicit opt-in LIFO scope mechanism instead of changing every existing plugin list.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772RI1","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"234f9cea4872346e2a8dd67ab853e2566d82a5a6ce6ac5c3374af327c519a934","observation_id":"aro_v1_enhzz2sioi2g4kun2z5lqu7ckz","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T23:52:41Z","review_id":"arr_v1_szk72x3mjnb5bveole7xlq3ka3","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"a14e96e22281887b621451a5488a88d7de1a49ff","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_qmbf7h27y4ixedhcpehovnj4lg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T23:52:41Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
